    <p class="vaidyam-static-lead" style="margin-bottom: 36px;">The edition, section, or article you are looking for may have been relocated or is currently being updated in our quarterly index.</p>
    <div style="display: flex; gap: 16px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap;">
      <a href="/" class="vaidyam-btn vaidyam-btn--primary vaidyam-btn--lg">Return to Vaidyam Home</a>
      <a href="/blogs/ayurveda" class="vaidyam-btn vaidyam-btn--outline vaidyam-btn--lg">Browse All Articles</a>
